# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files regardless of the
# committer's OS/git config — see plans/022-cross-platform-compatibility.md
# in the security-skill-workspace repo. Prevents a Windows contributor's
# local core.autocrlf from introducing CRLF into files this repo treats
# as LF-only (JSON schemas/data, Python source, golden test fixtures).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
